faqs:
- q: Is the storage secure and insured?
  a: Yes. We arrange secure, insured storage for belongings not moving straight into your new home.
- q: How long can I store my belongings?
  a: Gold Prestige includes up to 6 weeks of storage. If you need longer, talk to us when you plan your move so we can explain the options.
- q: What if my sale and my new home do not line up?
  a: That is exactly what storage is for. Up to 6 weeks of storage is included in Gold Prestige to bridge a gap between your sale completion and your move-in date.
- q: Can I store furniture while I am downsizing?
  a: Yes. If your new home is smaller, or you are not yet sure what will fit, Chayce can book storage for furniture and belongings and arrange collection and delivery when you need them.
- q: Do I have to arrange the storage myself?
  a: No. Chayce handles booking the storage and arranging collection or delivery when you need it.
- q: Do you work outside Northampton?
  a: Yes. We are based in Northampton and arrange moves across the whole UK.
- q: How much does storage cost?
  a: Gold Prestige ({gold}) includes up to 6 weeks of storage. If you need longer, or storage with another package, we explain the options, and the final price is confirmed in writing before you book.
- q: Is storage only for people who are downsizing?
  a: No. Storage helps when your sale and purchase dates do not line up, when you want to stage your current home with some furniture removed, or when you are not yet sure what will fit in a smaller home.
- q: Is storage included in every package?
  a: No. Up to 6 weeks of storage is part of Gold Prestige. Silver Comfort and Bronze Essentials do not include it, but talk to us about your dates if you need storage with another package. See our <a href="/packages/">packages</a>.
- q: What should I do before my belongings go into storage?
  a: Label each box with its contents and destination room, keep a list of what is stored, and keep documents, medication, valuables and a first night box with you. Our <a href="/blog/storage-when-moving-house-uk-how-it-works/">storage guide</a> has more.
